<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Cat FAQ</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: dark;
      --bg: #0b1020;
      --surface: #11182d;
      --surface-2: #17213a;
      --border: #2c3a5c;
      --text: #e8eefc;
      --muted: #b2bfdc;
      --accent: #8ab4ff;
      --accent-strong: #c6dbff;
      --shadow: 0 18px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
      --radius: 20px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      font: 16px/1.6 system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top, #1b2750 0%, transparent 36%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #0b1020 0%, #0a0f1a 100%);
      color: var(--text);
    }

    a {
      color: var(--accent);
    }

    .skip-link {
      position: absolute;
      left: 1rem;
      top: 1rem;
      padding: 0.75rem 1rem;
      background: var(--accent-strong);
      color: #09101f;
      border-radius: 999px;
      transform: translateY(-160%);
      transition: transform 0.18s ease;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .skip-link:focus {
      transform: translateY(0);
    }

    main {
      width: min(920px, calc(100% - 2rem));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 5rem 0 4rem;
    }

    .hero {
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02));
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-radius: 28px;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
      font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4.2rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .lead {
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 62ch;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }

    .faq-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }

    .example {
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--surface) 0%, #0f1628 100%);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      overflow: clip;
    }

    .question {
      width: 100%;
      appearance: none;
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text);
      text-align: left;
      padding: 1.15rem 1.25rem;
      font: inherit;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .question:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    }

    .question:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--accent);
      outline-offset: -3px;
    }

    .question .icon {
      flex: none;
      width: 1.75rem;
      height: 1.75rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--surface-2);
      display: inline-grid;
      place-items: center;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
    }

    .question .icon::before {
      content: "+";
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      line-height: 1;
      color: var(--accent-strong);
    }

    .example[aria-expanded="true"] .question .icon {
      transform: rotate(45deg);
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }

    .details {
      padding: 0 1.25rem 1.25rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .details p {
      margin: 0;
    }

    .details p + p {
      margin-top: 0.9rem;
    }

    .details ul {
      margin: 0.9rem 0 0;
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
    }

    .details li + li {
      margin-top: 0.35rem;
    }

    @media (forced-colors: active) {
      :root {
        --bg: Canvas;
        --surface: Canvas;
        --surface-2: Canvas;
        --border: ButtonBorder;
        --text: CanvasText;
        --muted: CanvasText;
        --accent: Highlight;
        --accent-strong: HighlightText;
      }

      .skip-link,
      .example,
      .question .icon {
        forced-color-adjust: auto;
      }

      .question:focus-visible {
        outline-color: Highlight;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to main content</a>

  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
      <h1 id="page-title">Cat FAQ</h1>
      <p class="lead">A quick guide to common cat questions, from their mysterious behavior to simple care basics.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="faq-list" aria-label="Frequently asked questions about cats">
      <div class="example" aria-expanded="false">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-1" id="question-1">
          <span>Why do cats knead with their paws?</span>
          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="answer-1" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-1" hidden>
          <p>Kneading is a comforting behavior that starts in kittenhood. Cats often do it when they feel relaxed, safe, or especially fond of a person or place.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example" aria-expanded="false">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-2" id="question-2">
          <span>Do cats really sleep most of the day?</span>
          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="answer-2" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-2" hidden>
          <p>Yes. Adult cats often sleep 12 to 16 hours a day, and some snooze even longer. They conserve energy for bursts of play, hunting instincts, and exploring their surroundings.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example" aria-expanded="false">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-3" id="question-3">
          <span>Why do cats bring home toys or, sometimes, other surprises?</span>
          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="answer-3" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-3" hidden>
          <p>Cats may be following their hunting instincts or sharing a “gift.” It can also be a sign that they see you as part of their social group.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="example" aria-expanded="false">
        <button class="question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="answer-4" id="question-4">
          <span>What makes a good cat-friendly home?</span>
          <span class="icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="details" id="answer-4" role="region" aria-labelledby="question-4" hidden>
          <p>Provide fresh water, a clean litter box, scratching options, cozy resting spots, and a few places to climb or observe the room. Predictable routines help too.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    document.querySelectorAll('.example').forEach((item) => {
      const button = item.querySelector('.question');
      const panel = item.querySelector('.details');

      button.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const expanded = button.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';
        button.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!expanded));
        item.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!expanded));
        panel.hidden = expanded;
      });
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
